        "rationale": "Three times $n$ is $3n$; 7 less than that is $3n - 7$."
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "content": "$7 - 3n$",
        "rationale": "This is $3n$ less than 7: the order of a subtraction matters."
      },
      {
